<title>GERMANY: Blohm + Voss to cut 140 more jobs - union.</title>
<headline>Blohm + Voss to cut 140 more jobs - union.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German shipbuilder Blohm + Voss plans to fire 140 more workers in 1996/97, the company's works council said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The union rejected the measure, saying it would threaten the survival of the firm. Management believes the firings are needed due to sluggish orders and a poor financial situation, it said.</p>
<p>Company officials were unavailable for comment. Blohm + Voss announced cuts of 500 jobs in June.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
